### Map Order to OrderResponse
POST http://localhost:8131/api/orders/map
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 200,
  "orderNumber": "ORD-99999",
  "customer": {
    "id": 2,
    "name": "Jane Smith",
    "email": "jane@example.com"
  }
}

### Get Sample Order
GET http://localhost:8131/api/orders/sample
